Z||000000||grinthock||06-08-2001||06:58 AM||||Just a reminder to those who didn't make the last show night, started between 5:30 and 6pm (but people show up right till 6:30), there is a show put on by the Hamilton Optimist Club this monday the 11th at HUTCHES in hamilton<BR> <A HREF="http://www.mapquest.com/cgi-bin/share?spz5a2d34iwcxfzx"" TARGET=_blank>http://www.mapquest.com/cgi-bin/share?spz5a2d34iwcxfzx"</A>  <P>280 VAN WAGNERS BEACH RD in Hamilton ON.<P>There is a mapquest link for the location if need be or post here and I can help you out... Who's coming?  I would assume BanditBalz!  We should get the 88GT Turbo to come out, and maybe HotRodBob<P>This is the new meeting place once a week here in the niagra region and everyone's invited (excluding ricers!)<P>Jay --- You comin?<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://grinthock.2y.net/pics/87gt/S_P000386.JPG">   <P>Home page: &lt;A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com<BR>Home" TARGET=_blank&gt;http://www.fieroworld.com<BR>Home&lt;/A&gt;  of the fiero voting booth!<BR>Owner of 85 GT<BR>87 GT Silver<BR>1995 Ford Escort Wagoon POS<p>[This message has been edited by grinthock (edited 06-08-2001).]||||reg||1
